 "source": "Screens: every loading movie the community install holds (Assets_manifest.txt rows with .gfx, .swf and .lst; packs Assets_000-008), with the stock LoadingScreen.xml ids. The stock file's live rows on a 2026 clock are only Ids 1, 37 and 75 (4 is US only); 72, 80, 82 and 86 ended in 2013-14. The client draws from LoadingScreen.xml by weight and takes no loading screen from the server (src/splash_screens.rs), so 'default' is what a launcher-written LoadingScreen.xml lists, the dock rows are the client's Tutorial-state movies for ZoneConfig (switched off, see dock_movies), and every other row is (R): a themed choice per Games window category (ActivityCategories.txt ids) and zone (zones.json ids) for a client that can be told a screen. Weights are (R). Tips: the stock file's StringIds and weights.",
 "rotation": "weighted",
 "dock_movies": false,
